      "rule": "Respect elders",
      "note": "Address older people first; use both hands when giving or receiving items."
    },
    {
      "e": "🚫",
      "rule": "No durian indoors",
      "note": "Durian is banned on the MRT and in many hotels due to its strong smell."
    },
    {
      "e": "👟",
      "rule": "Remove shoes",
      "note": "Take off shoes before entering homes and some traditional shops."
    },
    {
      "e": "🍽️",
      "rule": "Chope a table",
      "note": "At hawker centres, reserve a table by leaving a packet of tissues on it — this is called \"chope-ing.\""
    },
    {
      "e": "🤝",
      "rule": "Handshakes are common",
      "note": "A light handshake is standard; Malay Muslims may not shake hands across genders."
    }
  ],
  "money": [
